{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_chemin_rb","introduces":[{"id":"pr1","type":"math","content":"P(R_1) = \\dfrac{5}{8}"},{"id":"info2","type":"text","content":"7 boules : 4 R, 3 B"},{"id":"pb2","type":"math","content":"P(B_2 \\mid R_1) = \\dfrac{3}{7}","layout":{"next_to":"info2","direction":"down","gap":"md"}},{"id":"prb","type":"math","content":"P(R \\text{ puis } B) = \\dfrac{5}{8} \\times \\dfrac{3}{7} = \\dfrac{15}{56}","layout":{"next_to":"pb2","direction":"down","gap":"md"}}],"beats":[{"id":"b1","say":"Premier chemin : la première boule est rouge. Sur les huit boules du départ, cinq sont rouges, donc la probabilité est de cinq sur huit.","cues":[{"id":"c_rouge","text":"la première boule est rouge"},{"id":"c_cinq","text":"cinq sur huit"}],"do":[{"id":"f_ligne","verb":"fade_out","target":"ligne","at":"cue:c_rouge"},{"id":"f_note7","verb":"fade_out","target":"note7","at":"cue:c_rouge"},{"id":"s_pr1","verb":"show","target":"pr1","at":"cue:c_cinq"},{"id":"h_pr1","verb":"highlight","target":"pr1","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_cinq","end":"cue_end:c_cinq"}]},{"id":"b2","say":"Cette rouge partie, il reste sept boules : quatre rouges et trois bleues. La bleue a donc trois chances sur sept.","cues":[{"id":"c_sept","text":"sept boules"},{"id":"c_trois","text":"trois chances sur sept"}],"do":[{"id":"s_info2","verb":"show","target":"info2","at":"cue:c_sept"},{"id":"s_pb2","verb":"show","target":"pb2","at":"cue:c_trois"}]},{"id":"b3","say":"On multiplie le long du chemin, parce que les deux tirages s'enchaînent. Cinq sur huit fois trois sur sept donne quinze sur cinquante-six.","cues":[{"id":"c_multiplie","text":"On multiplie"},{"id":"c_quinze","text":"quinze sur cinquante-six"}],"do":[{"id":"s_prb","verb":"show","target":"prb","at":"cue:c_multiplie"},{"id":"h_prb","verb":"highlight","target":"prb","role":"result","at":"cue:c_quinze"}]}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_chemin_br","introduces":[{"id":"pb1","type":"math","content":"P(B_1) = \\dfrac{3}{8}"},{"id":"info3","type":"text","content":"7 boules : 5 R, 2 B"},{"id":"pr2","type":"math","content":"P(R_2 \\mid B_1) = \\dfrac{5}{7}","layout":{"next_to":"info3","direction":"down","gap":"md"}},{"id":"pbr","type":"math","content":"P(B \\text{ puis } R) = \\dfrac{3}{8} \\times \\dfrac{5}{7} = \\dfrac{15}{56}","layout":{"next_to":"pr2","direction":"down","gap":"md"}}],"beats":[{"id":"b1","say":"Deuxième chemin : la première boule est bleue. Trois bleues sur huit au départ, donc trois sur huit.","cues":[{"id":"c_bleue","text":"la première boule est bleue"},{"id":"c_trois","text":"trois sur huit"}],"do":[{"id":"s_pb1","verb":"show","target":"pb1","at":"cue:c_bleue"},{"id":"h_pb1","verb":"highlight","target":"pb1","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_trois","end":"cue_end:c_trois"}]},{"id":"b2","say":"Il reste alors sept boules : cinq rouges et deux bleues. La rouge a cinq chances sur sept.","cues":[{"id":"c_sept","text":"sept boules"},{"id":"c_cinq","text":"cinq chances sur sept"}],"do":[{"id":"s_info3","verb":"show","target":"info3","at":"cue:c_sept"},{"id":"s_pr2","verb":"show","target":"pr2","at":"cue:c_cinq"}]},{"id":"b3","say":"On multiplie encore le long du chemin : trois sur huit fois cinq sur sept donne quinze sur cinquante-six.","cues":[{"id":"c_multiplie","text":"On multiplie"},{"id":"c_quinze","text":"quinze sur cinquante-six"}],"do":[{"id":"s_pbr","verb":"show","target":"pbr","at":"cue:c_multiplie"},{"id":"h_pbr","verb":"highlight","target":"pbr","role":"result","at":"cue:c_quinze"}]}]}}
